ositive result was 97  and the predictive value of a negative result was 95   In this laboratory  we also compared the results of staining of 100 routinely processed breast carcinomas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  10 AUG 98 at 13 20 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast CA   is an oriented REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 0cm breast fragment with a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm stellate  firm  tan pink mass  0 6cm from the superior  REMOVED_DATE from the lateral  0 8cm from the anterior  and 1 0cm from the posterior margin  The remainder of the parenchyma is predominantly fatty  The tumor is submitted entirely along with margins as follows  A B  radial sections to superior margin  C  anterior and lateral margins  with lateral surface overinked blue  D  posterior and anterior margins  posterior surface overinked blue  E  other tumor sections   br , 3.
