eatest diameter each  GRADE  2  LYMPHATIC VESSEL INVASION  Not identified  BLOOD VESSEL INVASION  Not identified  MARGIN OF INVASIVE CARCINOMA  The distances to all margins measure 0 2cm or greater  STAINS FOR RECEPTORS  Requested on block    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Note  Immunohistochemical stains for e cadherin were performed on slides  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   The immunostains for e cadherin are negative in areas of invasive lobular carcinoma and negative in areas of lobular carcinoma in situ  supporting the diagnoses  GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab  labeled  left axilla sentinel node hot blue   REMOVED_CASE_ID    is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm lymph node  which is bisected and frozen entirely as FX 1 and FX 1A  now as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   respectively  Received are 3 containers  which are all  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  Received fresh  labeled  left breast mastectomy  short stitch superior and long stitch lateral   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 0cm left simple mastectomy specimen with a short stitch designating superior and a long stitch designating lateral  The specimen is inked as follows  Anterior   blue and posterior   black  On sectioning  the breast parenchyma of the upper inner quadrant at approximately 11 o clock position shows an irregularly tan pink and gray white  firm to hard tumor measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 1cm  The tumor is located 0 7cm from the nearest posterior resection margin and 1 0cm from the nearest anterior resection margin  Approximately 0 6cm lateral to the tumor  the breast parenchyma of the upper inner and upper outer quadrant shows another poorly circumscribed  gray white to tan pink  firm to hard tumor measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 9cm and located 1 0cm from the nearest posterior resection margin and 1 8cm from the nearest anterior resection margin  The breast parenchyma of the upper inner quadrant also shows another irregularly outlined tan pink firm tumor measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm and located 1 2cm from the nearest anterior margin  1 2cm from the nearest posterior margin  and 1 0cm lateral to the larger tumor  The remaining breast parenchyma consists of admixed fatty tissue and dense pink white fibrous stroma which extends up to both the inked anterior and posterior resection margins and shows a few cysts measuring from REMOVED_DATE up to 0 5cm in greatest dimension  Obvious lymph nodes are not identified  Representative sections are submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Larger tumor with nearest inked margins  approximately 11 o clock position   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Smaller tumor  lateral to the larger tumor  approximately at 12 o clock position   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lesion  upper inner quadrant nodule   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Breast parenchyma  outer quadrant  predominantly lower outer quadrant  away from all the 3 lesions  Received fresh  labeled  additional superficial margin   are multiple  irregularly outlined and unoriented fragments of fibrofatty breast tissue aggregating to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x up to 0 8cm  The larger fragments are bisected or serially sectioned  Obvious tumor is not identified  Submitted entirely in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh  labeled  left breast skin   is an irregularly outlined and unoriented fragment of tan pink skin measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x up to 0 5cm  The skin surface is grossly unremarkable  The specimen is inked black and serially sectioned  Submitted entirely in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION  1 AND  1A  LEFT AXILLARY SENTINEL NODE  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  Final Diagnosis by Ronald Balassanian M D   Electronically signed on Monday REMOVED_MONTH 05   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 03 03 07PM By his her signature 